  "notes": "Only the right side was in hand (all four photos); the left is assumed to carry the same design (mirrored on the fin). The aft fuselage's pastel gingham (olive, mustard, pink, purple diamonds fading forward) is drawn as one average tint; the hatched squares are drawn as one pink. The slogan under the title is per aircraft. 'from' left out: no dated source in hand for this scheme's introduction. Re-checked 2026-11-15 on EC-NGL (A319, 2026-10-06, flipped): 'VOLOTEA' runs x 0.193-0.375 and the slogan 0.193-0.289; their heights agree.",
